      "writtenOn": "2017-12-20T03:59:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "actually we need a writable callback in the dput.\nyou can think of \"sdcardfs_d_delete\" is an another callback in the d_delete at the specific position, I mean:\n\n\tif (unlikely(dentry-\u003ed_flags \u0026 DCACHE_DISCONNECTED))\n\t\tgoto kill_it;\n\n\u003e\u003e\u003e\u003e d_lock unlock and relock safe\n\tif (unlikely(dentry-\u003ed_flags \u0026 DCACHE_OP_DELETE)) {\n\t\tif (dentry-\u003ed_op-\u003ed_delete(dentry))\n\t\t\tgoto kill_it;\n\t}\n\u003c\u003c\u003c\u003c\n\n\tdentry_lru_add(dentry);",
      "parentUuid": "c4ef2ad8_5a2ecd58",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 92,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 92,
